WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.635
Instagram styling turns a comment into help choosing an outfit.

2
00:00:05.635 --> 00:00:09.315
It connects interest in a post with a way to shop.

3
00:00:09.315 --> 00:00:15.390
A STYLE comment starts a private reply. The customer replies to continue.

4
00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:21.465
The stylist asks occasion and budget, checks real products, and suggests looks.

5
00:00:21.465 --> 00:00:25.315
Shopping links lead to the website or a confirmed store.
